WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:06,310
Whatever drug you gave us

2
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:07,710
Just a little sleeping pill

3
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:09,270
Just sleep for one night and you'll be fine

4
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:11,690
You stole the supplies

5
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:16,140
All our supplies are gone and you didn't steal them.

6
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:17,860
Why did you steal our car and run away at night?

7
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,540
I really didn’t steal Brother Meng

8
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:22,400
You understand me, right? I stole it.

9
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,680
Just take things out

10
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:29,700
The back door was not as safe as expected last time

11
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,020
Go hide in the basement first

12
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:34,080
Mingyu is still upstairs and we all go upstairs.

13
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,240
Let's go upstairs too

14
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:38,170
The things are still upstairs, Captain Han

15
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:39,330
Not safe upstairs

16
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:42,490
There is a safe passage in the basement, so you can leave directly without using it.

17
00:00:43,010 --> 00:00:44,690
Dozens of zombies are a trivial matter
